        "original_id": "6af144e6-f6fe-50be-a450-c1074bf7663c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Max Carl, Denis Bélanger\n- Bands: 38 Special, Voivod\n- Albums: Bone Against Steel, Resolution\n\nFacts:\n- Max Carl Gronenthal was born on January 29, 1950, and he is an American rock singer, keyboardist, guitarist, and songwriter.\n- Denis \"Snake\" Bélanger was born on August 9, 1964, and he is the vocalist and lyricist of the Canadian heavy metal band Voivod.\n- Bone Against Steel was 38 Special's last album before the band's 1996 comeback, and it was the last 38 Special album to feature vocalist and keyboard player Max Carl.\n- Resolution was 38 Special's first album since Bone Against Steel in 1991 and was released after the band reformed in 1996.",
